の人権対応を他社のリアルな取組事例から学ぶセミナーをベトナムにてオンライン形式で開催します。ビジネスと人権に取り組み始めたばかりの企業様や、取組方に悩んでいる企業様は、ぜひ御参加ください！\n●開催日時：2026年11月25日(水)13:00～14:45 \n●申込方法：URLはリプライ欄に記載\n●オンライン開催\n●参加無料"}}},"rest_id":"2122897425715380546","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"2725","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}}},{"entryId":"list-conversation-2122907703528390657-tweet-2122897587078574469","item":{"clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"rest_id":"https://t.co/e8HD7EVidx"},"cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":2},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1082102533454102528/HXpr1ZEl_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/303730149/1791191305"},"core":{"created_at":"Mon May 23 10:17:04 +0000 2011","name":"外務省","screen_name":"MofaJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjozMDM3MzAxNDk=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{"tweet_ids_str":["2121231273465401462"]},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"外務省の公式アカウントです。外交に関する新着情報を中心に発信しております。｜英語版（English）@MofaJapan_en\n｜外務省ソーシャルメディア一覧： https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sn…","expanded_url":"https://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/annai/sns/list_jp.html","indices":[81,104],"url":"https://t.co/2VDfT2CQ5p"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mofa.go.jp/mofaj/","expanded_url":"http://www.mofa.go.jp/mofaj/","